Phasmid: WebAuthn hybrid transport

What:     getClientCapabilities() hybridTransport, and with it
          passkeyPlatformAuthenticator, follow
          capabilities.bluetooth_available without asking BlueZ. A claimed
          adapter on a host without one is reported, and a hybrid passkey
          flow then fails.
Why:      hybridTransport exposes whether the host has a Bluetooth LE
          adapter, which must match the claimed device.
Profile:  capabilities.bluetooth_available
Hooks:    content/browser/webauth/authenticator_common_impl.cc
          AuthenticatorCommonImpl::IsHybridTransportSupported
Contexts: main, iframe; workers have no PublicKeyCredential
Guard:    tests/guards/platform/webauthn-hybrid.py

